# Design sources: the .dc.html prototypes are the input to tools/dc2tsx.py, so
# they ship — a generated component nobody can regenerate is dead weight. The
# 127M of design-tool image uploads do not.
GatherDesign/*
!GatherDesign/*.dc.html
!GatherDesign/assets/
!GatherDesign/assets/**
GatherDesign/* v1.dc.html

